    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Whether free cash flow margin stays above the FY2025 high of 7.4% or falls back toward the -4.1% median [D560][D561]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Whether net cash returns above zero from -$596.3 million in FY2025, given buybacks at 171.7% of free cash flow [D399][D402]."}
  ]}
